07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C24MHgl_rpsQ7kNvwEH6c5q&_nc_oc=AdpnC_XCohnzHR-4or1ga8JSKJ_qFgliPGWgYAx8a71VV3zDPq3XVK69GjLPUJJqybc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRF-WzBaUpKu6qtOaetlg8aDY-wFWWBdckRUeB0-XhJg&oe=6AF47942"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y1XjwOCTiAsQ7kNvwF7ayqO&_nc_oc=AdrThb5W8rskUVBykimGBZ51vDUWeYaK2mdTAzRiiaX_aoZCbeilv9CGPnTm6EqyUfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQiwuBbIJsqa4ZzsXMs2xn4P--DOf3BhUThqmGtYesiPA&oe=6AF46EBF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zHb4XZedW3IQ7kNvwEjFx9J&_nc_oc=AdoEoty13l6_meSQbo1AxIbSXNmSBLBfnc3Iai5soDIN0-wvzn2_45vPvg1BopkTQ6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSQuO6a3sYuZn8qu-kqwAUYbVm4s0TgOUKi9CAv4ukU3g&oe=6AF47DB0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic